# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Fiesta
# Ford Fiesta Mk4 (BE91): launched October 1995, production to December 2002.
# Britain's best-selling car 1996-1998, when the Focus overtook it. UK
# registrations 129,574 (1995), 139,552 (1996) and 116,110 (1998).
#
# Colours: State Blue, Moondust Silver, Radiant Red, Panther Black. The paint
# names are the actual Ford offerings with their availability years (State/
# Lugano Blue mica 1995-2026, Moondust Silver 1991-2026, Radiant Red 1988-2006,
# Panther Black mica 1997-2019). These are the four largest measured DVSA
# first-registration shares over the model's road years 1995-2002: blue 24.5%,
# silver 21.8%, red 15.1%, black 9.3%. Silver rose from 9.0% (1995) to 32.6%
# (2002) across those years.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour by observed road presence. Weights total 500,
# the 2026-11-15 anchor convention for the Fiesta (provisional; a central
# rebase follows), split 24.5:21.8:15.1:9.3.

